# Consumer Android WebView Shell — Canonical Path

The active Android shell for the Consumer PWA (`https://beamio.app/app/`) is:

```text
src/CaehTrees/
```

This project loads SilentPassUI Consumer PWA content and owns Consumer-native
WebView bridges such as `CashTreesAndroid.saveFile`, camera, external URL, push,
and embedded PWA update behavior.

## Product separation

| Product | Android source | PWA |
|---|---|---|
| Consumer app | `src/CaehTrees/` | `src/SilentPassUI/` → `/app/` |
| POS terminal shell | `src/android/softPOS/` | `src/posPwa/` → `/pos/` |

`src/android/softPOS/` is the POS shell, not the Consumer app shell. Do not
implement Consumer `/app/` bridge, download, camera, OTA, or wallet behavior
there.

## Required checks

- Consumer Android shell changes must be made under `src/CaehTrees/`.
- Consumer PWA bridge calls must be mirrored by `CaehTrees` native handlers
  when native behavior is required.
- Validate with the Gradle project under `src/CaehTrees/`; do not use the
  `src/android/softPOS/` build as Consumer validation.
- New Consumer PWA features may retain browser fallbacks, but native-shell
  behavior must use the `CaehTrees` bridge.
- Do not modify abandoned `src/android-NDEF/` for either product.

## Common mistake

```text
Wrong Consumer target: src/android/softPOS/
Correct Consumer target: src/CaehTrees/
```
